          "heading": "Fabien Galthié’s France target repeat victory following November win over Fiji",
          "body": "France secured a 34-21 victory over Fiji in their last meeting during the November 2025 international friendly window. This result remains the sole recent encounter between the sides as they prepare for their upcoming Nations Championship Round four fixture. Following a 42-15 win against Japan in Round three, Fabien Galthié’s men currently sit third in the tournament standings. The team has recorded two wins and one loss across three matches, scoring 116 points while conceding 75."
